        "original_id": "d8156e16-419e-5524-88da-dae67aa0548c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andy Merrill\n- Characters: Brak, Space Ghost, Zorak\n- Shows: Space Ghost, Space Ghost Coast to Coast, Cartoon Planet\n- Companies: Hanna-Barbera, Cartoon Network\n- Topics: voice acting, television writing, production\n\nFacts:\n- Brak is a fictional supervillain character from the 1966 Hanna-Barbera animated series \"Space Ghost.\"\n- In \"Space Ghost,\" Brak is portrayed as a catlike alien space pirate who tries to conquer the galaxy.\n- \"Space Ghost's Musical Bar-B-Que\" features songs and skits by Space Ghost and his arch enemies Zorak and Brak.\n- Andy Ronald Merrill was born on November 27, 1966, in Newark, Ohio.\n- Andy Merrill is an American television writer, producer, and voice actor.\n- Andy Merrill is best known for his comedy voice portrayal of Brak on \"Space Ghost Coast to Coast,\" \"Cartoon Planet,\" and related Cartoon Network productions that use characters from the \"Space Ghost\" series.",
